===Etymology===
{{unk|en}}. Compare {{m|en|thingum}}, {{m|en|thingamabob}}, etc..

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|slang}} Something that one does not know the name of.
#: ''He used this, this... this '''thingamajig''' you saw him with the other day to fix the problem.''

